## Devices: refused work from a replaced connection. No peer text or private values.

# Whole refusal for the changed place; wraps in the existing notice.
device-target-changed = The machine’s connection changed. Refresh its devices and try again.

# Whole refusal for the list-changed place; wraps in the existing notice.
device-target-list-changed = Could not list devices because the machine’s connection changed. Refresh its devices and try again.

# Whole refusal for the invite-changed place; wraps in the existing notice.
device-target-invite-changed = Could not make a pairing link because the machine’s connection changed. Refresh its devices and make a new link.

# Whole refusal for the revoke-changed place; wraps in the existing notice.
device-target-revoke-changed = Could not confirm access was revoked because the machine’s connection changed. Refresh its devices before trying again.

